OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 18 JAN
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GTalented young soloists,
OL,6,     Gviolinist Ludvig Gudim and
OL,7,     Gpianist Valdemar Wenzel Most
OL,8,     Gperform a recital at the church
OL,9,     Gin Nyborg, Denmark.
OL,10,G0630FBreakfast
OL,11,     GMark Forrest presents Radio 3's
OL,12,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,13,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,14,G0900FSunday Morning
OL,15,     GPetroc Trelawny with three hours
OL,16,     Gof classical music to reflect,
OL,17,     Grestore and refresh, whether
OL,18,     Gyou're hunkering down with a book
OL,19,     Gor heading for a walk in the
OL,20,     Ghills.
