OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 18 JAN
OL,4,G1200FPrivate Passions
OL,5,     GTV presenter Peter Purves shares
OL,6,     Ghis musical passions with Michael
OL,7,     GBerkeley, and talks about his
OL,8,     Gcareer on Blue Peter, Doctor Who
OL,9,     Gand Crufts.
OL,10,G1330FMusic Map
OL,11,     GBruch's Violin Concerto No.1 is
OL,12,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch's destination
OL,13,     Gon today's Music Map. Along with
OL,14,     Gway, she travels via Bach,
OL,15,     GStravinsky and Stephane Grappelli.
OL,16,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,17,     GFrom St Lawrence Church, York,
OL,18,     Gwith the Ebor Singers, with music
OL,19,     Gby Richard Allain, Lucy Walker,
OL,20,     GBairstow and Buxtehude.
