OL,10,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,11,     GHannah French presents a concert
OL,12,     Ggiven in Lisbon by Hesperion XXI,
OL,13,     Gdirected by Jordi Savall,
OL,14,     Gfeaturing consort music by
OL,15,     Gcomposers such as Dowland,
OL,16,     GPurcell, Bach, Ferrabosco & Lawes.
