OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 18 JAN
OL,4,G1800FWords and Music
OL,5,     GIn her autobiography, Agatha
OL,6,     GChristie details her singing and
OL,7,     Gpiano lessons and her hopes of
OL,8,     Gbecoming a professional
OL,9,     Gperformer; and music features in
OL,10,     Gthe plots of her novels.
OL,11,G1915FSunday Feature: The Music Man for
OL,12,     FAfrica
OL,13,     GLeo Sarkisian created Voice of
OL,14,     GAmerica's acclaimed show Music
OL,15,     GTime in Africa. He recorded
OL,16,     Ghundreds of musicians and helped
OL,17,     Gnewly independent African states
OL,18,     Gfind their musical voice.
